  "packageHash": "1Z4Jz/GlZQrfPIerNTqszdnYu3XTdYGcWfK4TptOaWovB0um6jWYf4Kc08DU9YzalgTZoxV2LA0TjipGCLbEDQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 75012,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/lijon2015/yarp-swagger",
  "published": "2026-04-30T13:38:25.55Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 - Major rewrite. No backward compatibility with v2.x.\n - Replaced ISwaggerEndpointProvider with a five-interface discovery pipeline:\n   ISwaggerEndpointDiscoveryService, ISwaggerEndpointSource,\n   ISwaggerEndpointAddressResolver, ISwaggerMetadataAccessor, ISwaggerRefreshTrigger.\n - SwaggerEndpointDiscoveryResult now exposes structured per-cluster diagnostics so\n   skipped/failed clusters can be explained in logs.\n - Removed the fake \"/swagger/v1/swagger.json\" UI placeholder. UI urls now reflect only\n   real discovered documents; configurable EmptyBehavior controls what happens when\n   discovery returns zero documents.\n - New UseSwaggerAggregationDocuments() middleware owns 200/404/503 semantics. Unknown\n   documents return 404 with a known-document list; known-but-unavailable returns\n   503 (configurable).\n - Refresh is event-driven: options change, periodic timer, and YARP config change tokens.\n   Project-specific triggers can be added via the builder.\n - SwaggerAggregationBuilder grew AddSource, AddAddressResolver, InsertAddressResolver,\n   AddRefreshTrigger, and ConfigureDocumentEndpoint hooks.\n - Telemetry tags and metric names aligned with the long-term plan\n   (cluster.id, document.name, destination.address, http.status_code, failure.stage).\nSee CHANGELOG.md for migration notes.",
